@startuml
title PayLink - Sequence Diagram: Pay a Bill (Login to Confirmation)

actor Customer
participant "PayLink System" as PL
participant "Biller System\n(ElectroCo/AquaCo/TopUpNet)" as Biller
participant "Notification Service\n(SMS / Push)" as Notify

Customer -> PL: Login (credentials)
alt Wrong login
  PL --> Customer: Login failed (show error)
else Login successful
  PL --> Customer: Login success

  Customer -> PL: Select service and enter bill details
  PL -> Biller: Send bill inquiry (service/account details)
  Biller --> PL: Return bill amount
  PL --> Customer: Show bill amount, service fee, total (fee preview)

  Customer -> PL: Confirm payment (payment request + idempotency key)
  PL -> PL: Validate limits, velocity, fraud checks

  alt Insufficient available balance
    PL --> Customer: Payment rejected (insufficient balance)
  else Sufficient balance
    PL -> PL: Hold total amount (FundsHeld)
    PL -> Biller: Submit payment request (SentToBiller)

    alt Payment failed (biller rejects or fails)
      Biller --> PL: Payment failed result
      PL -> PL: Release held funds (Failed)
      PL -> Notify: Send failure notification (SMS/Push)
      Notify --> PL: Notification accepted/scheduled
      PL --> Customer: Confirmation: Payment Failed (with reference)
    else Payment successful
      Biller --> PL: Payment success result
      PL -> PL: Mark payment Completed
      PL -> Notify: Send success notification (SMS/Push)
      Notify --> PL: Notification accepted/scheduled
      PL --> Customer: Confirmation: Payment Completed (with reference)
    end
  end
end

@enduml